WEBVTT

00:00:07.263 --> 00:00:11.384
Tina Daniels is 13 years old and she's a star.

00:00:11.404 --> 00:00:14.696
She can sing and dance.

00:00:14.756 --> 00:00:16.726
Everyone knows her.

00:00:16.786 --> 00:00:18.996
Everyone loves her.

00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:24.438
They call her curls because she has beautiful curly hair.

00:00:24.498 --> 00:00:26.849
They all want her photos.

00:00:26.909 --> 00:00:29.990
She can have anything she wants.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.941
But is she happy?

00:00:33.001 --> 00:00:36.928
Does she want to be a star?

00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:41.274
Tina, why are you eating chocolates?

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.134
Her mother asks.

00:00:43.194 --> 00:00:44.705
I like them.

00:00:44.765 --> 00:00:46.166
They're nice.

00:00:46.226 --> 00:00:47.956
Tina says.

00:00:48.016 --> 00:00:50.066
You're getting fat.

00:00:50.126 --> 00:00:54.058
And a fat girl doesn't get lots of money in Hollywood.

00:00:54.118 --> 00:00:56.258
Mrs. Daniel says.

00:00:56.318 --> 00:00:57.969
You want the money?

00:00:57.989 --> 00:00:59.820
I don't.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.380
Tina says.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.511
Tina's angry with her mother.

00:01:05.571 --> 00:01:08.838
And Mrs. Daniel's is angry with Tina.

00:01:08.898 --> 00:01:11.724
Tina leaves the room and cries.

00:01:11.784 --> 00:01:14.164
Tina is very sad.

00:01:14.224 --> 00:01:16.905
She doesn't want to be a star.

00:01:16.965 --> 00:01:19.936
She wants a quiet life.

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:24.168
One day, she has an idea.

00:01:24.227 --> 00:01:30.790
Her school friend, Mary, has a grandmother called Mrs. White.

00:01:30.849 --> 00:01:35.732
Old Mrs. White lives in the country, in stone church.

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:40.486
Tina has a photo of Mary in front of Mrs White's house.

00:01:40.546 --> 00:01:42.698
It looks very pretty.

00:01:42.758 --> 00:01:44.950
Not like the city.

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:49.124
Tina decides to go there.

00:01:49.184 --> 00:01:52.846
Tina's at the city station.

00:01:52.906 --> 00:01:56.580
She's wearing jeans and an old jumper.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.842
People don't know who she is.

00:01:59.902 --> 00:02:03.154
Where do you want to go, young girl?

00:02:03.214 --> 00:02:06.187
The man at the ticket office asks her.

00:02:06.246 --> 00:02:08.608
Stonechurch, please.

00:02:08.668 --> 00:02:10.739
When's the next train?

00:02:10.799 --> 00:02:12.820
Tina asked.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:19.354
The train leaves at two o'clock from Clapborne Three, the man says.

00:02:19.414 --> 00:02:22.876
Tina buys her ticket.

00:02:22.936 --> 00:02:26.618
Tina arrives at Stonechurch.

00:02:26.678 --> 00:02:29.870
She sees an old house near the river.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:32.552
It's the house in the photo.

00:02:32.611 --> 00:02:36.232
There are flowers and trees in the garden.

00:02:36.291 --> 00:02:39.112
Mrs. White must live here.

00:02:39.171 --> 00:02:41.273
Tina thinks.

00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:45.867
She goes to the front door and rings the bell.

00:02:45.927 --> 00:02:50.941
An old lady with white hair and a kind face opens the door.

00:02:50.961 --> 00:02:55.094
A black cat comes out too.

00:02:55.154 --> 00:02:57.506
Good afternoon.

00:02:57.526 --> 00:02:59.638
How are you?

00:02:59.698 --> 00:03:02.030
The old lady are.

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.932
Oh hello Mrs. White.

00:03:04.992 --> 00:03:07.137
My name's Tina.

00:03:07.197 --> 00:03:11.124
I'm a school friend of your granddaughter, Mary.

00:03:11.184 --> 00:03:13.876
Mary's school friend?

00:03:13.936 --> 00:03:16.268
How nice to meet you.

00:03:16.328 --> 00:03:19.341
What are you doing in stone church, Tina?

00:03:19.401 --> 00:03:21.523
Mrs White asked.

00:03:21.583 --> 00:03:25.026
Tina says she hates the city life.

00:03:25.086 --> 00:03:28.108
Well, says Mrs White.

00:03:28.168 --> 00:03:31.952
Come in and have a cup of tea, my dear.

00:03:32.012 --> 00:03:36.044
Tina and Mrs White drink tea and talk.

00:03:36.104 --> 00:03:39.403
Mrs. White doesn't know Tina's a star.

00:03:39.463 --> 00:03:43.184
She doesn't have a television or a radio.

00:03:43.244 --> 00:03:46.406
Tina's very happy.

00:03:46.466 --> 00:03:56.360
Mrs. White says, Tina, you can stay with me for a week, but first you must telephone your mother.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:01.552
Tina's angry with her mother and doesn't telephone her.

00:04:01.612 --> 00:04:04.182
Mother says yes.

00:04:04.242 --> 00:04:06.772
She says to Mrs. White later.

00:04:06.831 --> 00:04:09.430
Her face is a little red.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:14.192
Two days later, Mrs White is taking Tina for a walk.

00:04:14.252 --> 00:04:19.304
Look at the lambs, Mrs White says.

00:04:19.364 --> 00:04:23.314
Yes, I love them.

00:04:23.374 --> 00:04:25.225
I want to be a lamb.

00:04:25.285 --> 00:04:28.396
They can jump and run and be happy.

00:04:28.456 --> 00:04:32.907
You can run and jump and be happy too, Tina.

00:04:32.967 --> 00:04:35.428
No, I can't.

00:04:35.488 --> 00:04:37.203
Tina.

00:04:37.262 --> 00:04:38.557
You're young!

00:04:38.617 --> 00:04:40.018
Run!

00:04:40.078 --> 00:04:43.718
Tina's living a very different life in the country.

00:04:43.778 --> 00:04:48.179
She sees new things all the time.

00:04:48.239 --> 00:04:51.170
Now it's night.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:54.540
And Tina and Mrs White are waiting.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.870
It's very quiet.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:02.292
Every night, some hedgehogs come to the garden.

00:05:02.352 --> 00:05:05.744
Mrs White puts out food for them.

00:05:05.804 --> 00:05:09.840
I love their long brown noses.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.092
Mrs. White says.

00:05:12.152 --> 00:05:15.905
So do I, says Tina.

00:05:15.964 --> 00:05:19.387
Oh look, says Tina.

00:05:19.447 --> 00:05:23.860
A big brown fox is running across the garden.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.054
At first, Tina's very happy to see the fox.

00:05:28.114 --> 00:05:31.766
There aren't any foxes in gardens in the city.

00:05:31.826 --> 00:05:36.334
Then, she sees the fox has something in its mouth.

00:05:36.394 --> 00:05:40.270
The something is Mrs. White's chicken.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:46.775
Mrs. White is very angry and wants to kill the fox.

00:05:46.835 --> 00:05:52.130
Mrs. White and Tina look at the fox's work.

00:05:52.189 --> 00:05:56.774
The chickens are making a terrible noise.

00:05:56.834 --> 00:06:01.678
We can't have eggs for breakfast in the morning, Tina.

00:06:01.737 --> 00:06:03.920
Says Mrs. White.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.722
Why not?

00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:07.784
Ask Tina.

00:06:07.844 --> 00:06:10.934
Well, the chickens aren't very happy.

00:06:10.994 --> 00:06:14.775
When they aren't happy, they can't give us eggs.

00:06:14.835 --> 00:06:17.576
Mrs. White explains.

00:06:17.636 --> 00:06:23.497
For breakfast, Tina has toast and fresh orange juice.

00:06:23.557 --> 00:06:28.758
Three days later, Tina is with Bella, a horse.

00:06:28.818 --> 00:06:32.742
She loves Bella and gives us some sugar.

00:06:32.802 --> 00:06:37.498
Today, the postman had a letter from his wife.

00:06:37.558 --> 00:06:44.095
When he sees Dina, he says, I don't believe it.

00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:46.527
It's curls.

00:06:46.587 --> 00:06:51.582
Then he says to her, everyone's looking for you.

00:06:51.642 --> 00:06:54.704
You're in all the newspapers.

00:06:54.764 --> 00:06:59.958
He runs to his red band to find his newspaper.

00:07:00.018 --> 00:07:04.909
Mrs. White reads the postman's newspaper.

00:07:04.969 --> 00:07:08.740
Tina, says Mrs. White.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:12.812
You're the last TV star, aren't you?

00:07:12.872 --> 00:07:15.442
I don't understand.

00:07:15.502 --> 00:07:17.453
Your mother?

00:07:17.513 --> 00:07:18.964
Yes.

00:07:19.024 --> 00:07:20.554
I'm Curls.

00:07:20.614 --> 00:07:22.925
But please don't send me home.

00:07:22.985 --> 00:07:26.556
I'm happy here with you.

00:07:26.616 --> 00:07:30.790
I'm coming with you to see your mother.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:33.554
I've got a good idea.

00:07:33.614 --> 00:07:36.145
Mrs. White says.

00:07:36.205 --> 00:07:41.258
Tina's mother is very happy to see Tina again.

00:07:41.318 --> 00:07:45.500
Mrs. White explains her idea.

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:53.144
Tina can go to her friends' school on the island of Guernsey between England and France.

00:07:53.204 --> 00:07:57.698
Tina can have friends there who don't know she's girls.

00:07:57.758 --> 00:07:59.458
What?

00:07:59.518 --> 00:08:04.660
I want Tina to be a star, Mrs. Daniel says.

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:08.231
She wants to be happy.

00:08:08.291 --> 00:08:11.042
Mrs. White says quietly.

00:08:11.102 --> 00:08:13.952
Tina's at school in Guernsey.

00:08:14.012 --> 00:08:18.173
She has new friends and new interests.

00:08:18.233 --> 00:08:22.814
One day, Tina's friend is reading a magazine.

00:08:22.874 --> 00:08:26.684
It's about film and television stars.

00:08:26.744 --> 00:08:49.953
there are lots of beautiful photos of beautiful people everyone looks very happy what a wonderful life the friend says Tina smiles to herself who wants to be a star she says I don't
